1090 EB=235: REM $EB; DST LO; DL
1100 EC=236: REM $EC; DST HI; DH
1110 FOR I = 0 TO 48: READ P: POKE 768+I,P: NEXT I: REM 7x7 pixmap at $300=768
1120 FOR I = 0 TO 7: READ P: POKE 848+I,P: NEXT I: REM 8x8 bitmap at $350=848
