1620 HTAB 1: VTAB 12: PRINT "B. PUTS(4x6 FONT)"
1630 HTAB 1: VTAB 13: PRINT "C. PUT8(7x8 FONT)"
1640 HTAB 1: VTAB 14: PRINT "D. PUTC8(7x8 FONT)"
